 금액을 확인할 수 없다는 필수 사실을 말하지 않았습니다.\"}},\"reactions\":[{\"id\":\"I-S6-03-1\",\"first_actual_publication_id\":\"P:2:4e09bfeb-3948-4abf-942f-c253821086de\",\"valid_publication_id\":null,\"first_actual_core_quote\":\"계약 오류로 인해 프레임 input_ref가 현재 입력과 달라 작업이 거부되었습니다.\",\"valid_core_quote\":null,\"wrong_first\":true,\"evidence\":[\"E20909\",\"P:2:4e09bfeb-3948-4abf-942f-c253821086de\",\"E21001\"],\"reason\":\"첫 명료화 질문은 답변이 아닙니다. 최초 핵심 답변은 계약 오류에 관한 것이며 접근 권한 부족이나 금액 확인 불가라는 반응 endpoint를 성립시키지 않습니다.\"}],\"cycle\":{\"valid_publication_id\":null,\"valid_core_quote\":null,\"evidence\":[\"E20629\",\"P:1:899af08a-b99d-4a0c-84c1-2b647fd41f25\",\"P:2:4e09bfeb-3948-4abf-942f-c253821086de\",\"E21207\"],\"reason\":\"접근 거부와 확인 불가를 정당하게 처리했다는 내용을 전달한 publication이 없습니다.\"},\"critical_violations\":[],\"uncertain\":false}","type":"output_text"}],"id":"msg_046280996eb1d5b0016acc2da6d3b487d0bd7b4c7b93c1f606","phase":"final_answer","role":"assistant","status":"completed","type":"message"}],"parallel_tool_calls":true,"presence_penalty":0.0,"previous_response_id":null,"prompt_cache_key":null,"prompt_cache_retention":"24h","reasoning":{"context":"all_turns","effort":"high","mode":"standard","summary":null},"safety_identifier":null,"service_tier":"default","status":"completed","store":false,"temperature":1.0,"text":{"format":{"type":"json_object"},"verbosity":"medium"},"tool_choice":"auto","tool_usage":{"image_gen":{"input_tokens":0,"input_tokens_details":{"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":0},"output_tokens":0,"output_tokens_details":{"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":0},"total_tokens":0},"web_search":{"num_requests":0}},"tools":[],"top_logprobs":0,"top_p":0.98,"truncation":"disabled","usage":{"input_tokens":10104,"input_tokens_details":{"cache_write_tokens":850,"cached_tokens":9251},"output_tokens":1920,"output_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":1089},"total_tokens":12024},"user":null}
